# PDFForge

Ship in gated phases. Do not start Phase 2 or 3 until the user confirms the current phase.

- Phase 1: folders, Docker, CI, `GET /health` only
- Phase 2: Axum OpenAPI, PDF engine, sanity tests — no Angular
- Phase 3: Angular 21 editor

Do not use Nx. Do not add a database. Do not send PDFs to external services.

Canonical skills:

- `skills/rust-pdf-engine/SKILL.md`
- `skills/angular-editor/SKILL.md`

Forbidden for text editing: white rectangle plus overlay text. Edit content streams instead.
